    family-names: Slocombe
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/SMTG-Bham/plottracer"
abstract: >-
  plottracer recovers the points of curves from plot images, including scanned
  figures and screenshots, and writes CSV in the plot's units. It also reads
  the drawing objects in PDF and SVG figures.
